# Mac Dev deploy derived-data (build → pkill → ditto → open)
build-dev/

# GENERATED Info.plists — xcodegen writes these from each target's `info:` block in
# project.yml, exactly like the .xcodeproj beside them. Tracking the output meant every
# branch that bumped CFBundleVersion edited FOUR files (project.yml + three plists), so
# every cross-branch merge collided on all four. project.yml is the source; run
# `xcodegen generate` after a pull, which the .xcodeproj already requires.
Skrift_Native/SkriftMobile/App/Info.plist
Skrift_Native/SkriftMobile/SkriftShare/Info.plist
Skrift_Native/SkriftMobile/SkriftWidget/Info.plist
*.egg
.pytest_cache/

